cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Improethics – Data Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks for analysing the listening study Improethics
  (Musical Ethics Lab). Participants marked, in real time, the moments at
  which they expected a recorded free improvisation to end. The notebooks
  analyse the distribution of these end marks, the sound recording and
  relations to the participants' personal background.
authors:
